Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 05:22:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Gulf studio: accessibility fixes (labs heading and frame
 title, glossary resize handle, contrast)

- Interactive Labs: frame title and a page heading for screen readers.
- Glossary resize handle reports its position (aria-valuenow), fixing a critical axe error.
- Readable secondary text in glossary, mock-exam modes, guide badges and dossier progress.
- Guide fact numbers get a valid role for their labels.
- Help text: 1,297 questions (was 1,350).
axe: 0 violations on home, guide, glossary, labs, tools, dossier and practice; npm test 103 checks pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
